    "body": "Hello — announcement, no action required.\n\nWe are maintaining a fork of vcmi-gym focused on the **strategic (adventure) layer** rather than combat: https://github.com/c18593395/vcmi-strategic-gym\n\n- Self-play RL (PPO) on HoMM3 adventure maps, ~3.5M training steps in, with a win/loss gating pipeline against built-in AIs\n- Observation: 3464-dim state + 4x21x21 terrain channel, 25 strategic actions (vs the upstream combat-layer MMAI direction — assets are intentionally kept apart to avoid mixing)\n- Released the current strategic model as ONNX so it can be loaded without our training stack: **bc_model_v3464b.onnx** (~1.85 MB) in release v3.0-strategic: https://github.com/c18593395/vcmi-strategic-gym/releases/tag/v3.0-strategic\n- CI runs on x86_64 + self-hosted ARM64 (Kunpeng-920)\n\nIf any of this looks useful or you would like to see the strategic Gym env integrated back in some form, happy to discuss. Thanks for the great upstream work so far.",
